      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2dea8d22470972dc58e995|full_name}: One of the inspirations for how to do things in VRChat was from one of the original creators' experience with Second Life, where what happened was lobbies where people would stand around staring at nothing writing in text chat. VRC wants to encourage human interaction, so text chat was ruled out as a feature to force everyone to use the 3D space to communicate.",
      "viewerReactions": null
