      "statusChangeID": "6019a5ce77405b22f3158a5a",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "These limits (editing slots limited to once per 60 minutes, 64 characters) are intentional, and for the time being, we have no plans to remove the limitations.\nFor some context, although we can't prevent users from attempting to using this system as a form of instant messaging, we have no desire to re-invent or implement a messaging system into VRChat at this time. As such, these limits are an attempt to discourage usage in that manner.",
      "viewerReactions": null
